  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, a new "Archipelago" window should appear in
    the top-right corner of the main menu.


    In the "Server Address" field, enter
    archipelago.gg: followed by the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find
    on the website after creating a new room.


    In "Slot Name", enter the name
    assigned to your YAML file.


    The "Password" field is optional. If the host
    did not set one, leave it blank.


    Finally, click "Connect" and then, you
    can start a new run!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
