  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, a new "Mods" button should appear in the main
    menu at the bottom-right, click it and you should see a  button called "Archipelago
    Randomizer", click the little cog icon at the bottom-right corner of the button,
    there you should see the Archipelago configs. To connect  click the "Connect"
    tab.


    In the "Server Adress" field, enter "archipelago.gg".


    In the
    "Port" field, enter the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the
    website after creating a new room.


    In "Slot Name", enter the name assigned
    to your YAML file.


    The "Password" field is optional. If the host did not
    set one, leave it blank.


    Finally, click "Connect" and then you can start
    playing!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
