  m_text: 'Risk Of Rain 2 is an Archipelago core game, meaning it does not require
    a custom world file (.apworld).

    Because of this, aside from installing the
    mods, all you need to do is create your YAML file using the "Options Creator"
    in the AP Launcher and send it to the person hosting the AP multiworld.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -9134737203265703719, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
