  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, you will find a new "Connect" button.


    In
    the "Address" field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port. This is a 5-digit
    number that you can find on the website after creating a new room.



    In
    "Slot Name", enter the name assigned to your YAML file.


    The "Password"
    field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.


    Finally,
    click the "Connect" button to connect and then you can start playing!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
