  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, (re)start the Archipelago Launcher and look
    for the "Portal 2 Client".


    Once the Portal 2 Text Client is open, in the
    top text field type "archipelago:XXXXX" where XXXXX is the port, you can find
    this 5-digit number on the Archipelago website after opening a new room.


    Finally,
    click "Connect" and then go back to the game and you can start playing!'
