  m_text: "When you click \"START SETUP\" in the \"SETUP\" tab, lethal_company.apworld
    will be installed and moved into the \"custom_worlds\" folder inside the Archipelago
    Launcher directory. \nBepInEx and the Archipelago mods + their dependencies will
    be downloaded into Lethal Company's core directory. The game will then launch
    and automatically close after a few seconds to ensure BepInEx is correctly initialized."
