  m_text: 'When you click "START SETUP" in the SETUP tab, powerwashsimulator.apworld
    will be installed and moved into the custom_worlds folder within the Archipelago
    Launcher directory.


    BepInEx will then be downloaded into the PowerWash
    Simulator game directory, along with the required mods, which will be placed
    in PowerWashSimulator\BepInEx\plugins. The game will then launch and automatically
    close after a few seconds to ensure BepInEx is properly initialized.


    The
    first launch after setup may take longer than usual (around 40 seconds).


    At
    the moment, only the manual setup is supported. A mod manager-based installation
    may be added in the future.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -9134737203265703719, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
