      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, click the "Solo" or "Multiplayer" button and
    you should see a new window in the middle.


    In "Archipelago Slot Name",
    enter the name assigned to your YAML file.


    The "Archipelago Server Password"
    field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.


    In the
    "Archipelago Server URL" field, enter "archipelago.gg".


    In "Archipelago
    Server Port" enter the room port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find
    on the website after creating a new room.


    Finally, click "Connect To AP"
    and then, you can start a new run!'
