  m_text: 'You have 2 revert options, both can''t be enabled at the same time.


    If
    you use the "Clear AP Mods" option it will only delete the mods that are required
    for Outer Wilds Archipelago.


    If you use the "Full Clear OWML" option it
    will delete everything related to OWML and mods. If other mods are detected an
    additionnal confirmation will appear.'
